+    # The exact-integer branch routed 0 through Decimal, whose ".2e" format
+    # renders it "0.00e+2" because zero carries no significant digit to anchor
+    # the exponent, so scientific(0) read "0.00 x 10²" while scientific(0.0)
+    # read "0.00 x 10⁰".
